{
  "id": "p27",
  "title": "Deadline at the Weekly Paper",
  "titleZh": "周报的截稿日",
  "topic": "周报编辑部",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Our weekly paper fills one entire floor of the old headquarters.",
        "zh": "我们周报占了旧总部整整一层楼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My section needs a strong performance before the morning print.",
        "zh": "我的版面需要一次出色的表现，赶在早晨付印之前。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An adult pays no entry fee for our simple online news.",
        "zh": "成年人阅读我们简单的在线新闻无需入场费。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A variety of stories exists on my crowded wooden desk.",
        "zh": "我拥挤的木桌上有各种各样的报道。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The editor approves each story that meets the requirement.",
        "zh": "编辑批准每一篇符合要求的报道。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My first challenge is a storm report, and I am eager.",
        "zh": "我的第一个挑战是一篇暴风雨报道，我跃跃欲试。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The flood covered the football pitch and the small car park.",
        "zh": "洪水淹没了足球场和小停车场。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A broken cable and a metal tube lie in the wet mud.",
        "zh": "一根断掉的电缆和一根金属管躺在湿泥里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then no casualty is reported, but one witness saw the water rise.",
        "zh": "然后没有人员伤亡的报告，但一位目击者看到水位上涨。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Police suspect two men and write a description of an armed stranger.",
        "zh": "警方怀疑两名男子，并写下一名持械陌生人的描述。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The paper bans offensive words in every crime report.",
        "zh": "本报禁止在每一篇犯罪报道中使用冒犯性的词。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A health survey covers ethnic background, age, and sexual health.",
        "zh": "一项健康调查涵盖族裔背景、年龄和性健康。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Doctors link each symptom to stress and simple psychology.",
        "zh": "医生把每个症状都与压力和简单的心理联系起来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later most patients recover and feel better within a single week.",
        "zh": "后来大多数病人在一周内康复，感觉好多了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A caring adviser answers every call at the small local clinic.",
        "zh": "一位有爱心的顾问在小诊所接听每一通电话。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Initially, few people join, and some remain reluctant.",
        "zh": "起初很少有人加入，有些人仍然不情愿。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A simple solution may help the local economy grow.",
        "zh": "一个简单的方案可能帮助当地经济增长。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young band plays at noon, just before the hard deadline.",
        "zh": "一支年轻乐队在中午演出，正好赶在截止时间之前。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One guy brings real discipline to our busy team.",
        "zh": "一个家伙为我们忙碌的团队带来了真正的纪律。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The story meets every expectation, and a historical note fits.",
        "zh": "这篇报道符合所有期待，一段历史注解也很合适。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My page looks truly good, and I feel pleased.",
        "zh": "我的版面看起来真的不错，我感到满意。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Personally, I have a good command of simple words.",
        "zh": "就我个人而言，我简单用词的能力还不错。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then we squeeze the last story in, but compromise on length.",
        "zh": "然后我们硬塞进最后一篇报道，但在篇幅上做了妥协。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The effect is partly clear, and readers notice it.",
        "zh": "效果部分清楚，读者也能注意到。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An enormous photo looks somewhat strange on this page.",
        "zh": "一张巨大的照片在这一页上显得有些奇怪。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I bet the long night will exhaust the whole tired team.",
        "zh": "我敢打赌，这漫长的一夜会让整个疲惫的团队精疲力尽。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A joint scheme may boost the town and its shops.",
        "zh": "一个联合方案可能会促进小镇及其商铺。"
      },
      {
        "en": "In spite of the cold wind, the killer stays calm.",
        "zh": "尽管有冷风，凶手依然保持平静。"
      }
    ]
  ],
